      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li>The \u02beam\u012br \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn \u1e24usayn the q\u0101\u02beid</li>\n<li>(Praise be to God, through him is my success)</li>\n<li>has received, out of a debt of nine d\u012bn\u0101rs, in the year</li>\n<li>five-hundred and seven, the dues of six months (reckoning at)</li>\n<li>eighteen and a half waraq dirhams (a month).</li>\n<li>He wrote (this) on the aforementioned date. </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
